---
import Layout from '../layouts/layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About — Eliana Betancur" description="Senior UX Engineer growing into design leadership, bridging design strategy and engineering reality.">
  <div class="px-6 sm:px-10 pt-8 pb-20">
    <div class="w-full page-reveal">


      <h1 class="font-display font-bold text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl leading-[1.1] mb-6">
        Senior UX Engineer growing into design leadership. I turn design decisions into products teams can build on.
      </h1>

      <p class="font-sans text-lg sm:text-xl text-warmgray-600 leading-relaxed mb-16">
        I sit at the intersection of design, engineering, and product. My work is not just about how something looks. It is about how it holds together when six teams are shipping against it.
      </p>

      <div class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-xl text-warmgray-800 mb-6">Background</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <p class="font-sans text-base text-warmgray-600 leading-relaxed">
            For four years at UnitedHealthcare I worked across the full product lifecycle. UX strategy, discovery, prototyping, and shipping accessible, consistent interfaces across multiple enterprise product teams.
          </p>
          <p class="font-sans text-base text-warmgray-600 leading-relaxed">
            A big part of that work was scaling the design system from something one team used to something the whole org relied on. That meant building documentation, establishing engineering handoff processes, leading a WCAG 2.1 AA compliance initiative, and working closely with accessibility teams to make good decisions stick.
          </p>
          <p class="font-sans text-base text-warmgray-600 leading-relaxed">
            I am currently finishing a Computer Science degree with a UX minor at DePaul, using coursework and side projects to stay hands-on with new front-end tech and push into more product and leadership-oriented work.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-xl text-warmgray-800 mb-6">What I bring</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
          <div class="bg-warmgray-200 rounded-lg p-6">
            <p class="font-mono text-xs text-rust-700 uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">UX</p>
            <p class="font-sans text-sm text-warmgray-800 leading-relaxed">
              End-to-end UX including strategy, research, prototyping, and shipping
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-warmgray-200 rounded-lg p-6">
            <p class="font-mono text-xs text-rust-700 uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Design Systems</p>
            <p class="font-sans text-sm text-warmgray-800 leading-relaxed">
              Token architecture, component APIs, contribution guidelines, and org-wide adoption
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-warmgray-200 rounded-lg p-6">
            <p class="font-mono text-xs text-rust-700 uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Accessibility</p>
            <p class="font-sans text-sm text-warmgray-800 leading-relaxed">
              WCAG 2.1 AA, keyboard navigation, ARIA patterns, and contrast compliance
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-warmgray-200 rounded-lg p-6">
            <p class="font-mono text-xs text-rust-700 uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Collaboration</p>
            <p class="font-sans text-sm text-warmgray-800 leading-relaxed">
              Cross-functional partnership across engineering, product, and accessibility teams
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-warmgray-200 rounded-lg p-6">
            <p class="font-mono text-xs text-rust-700 uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Engineering</p>
            <p class="font-sans text-sm text-warmgray-800 leading-relaxed">
              React, JavaScript, HTML, CSS, and component-based UI development
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-warmgray-200 rounded-lg p-6">
            <p class="font-mono text-xs text-rust-700 uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Leadership</p>
            <p class="font-sans text-sm text-warmgray-800 leading-relaxed">
              Growing into design leadership with experience driving org-wide initiatives and cross-team alignment
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mb-16">
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-xl text-warmgray-800 mb-6">Tools and skills</h2>
        <div class="bg-warmgray-200 rounded-lg p-8">
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-8">
            <div>
              <p class="font-mono text-xs text-warmgray-700 uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">Design</p>
              <ul class="space-y-2">
                <li class="font-sans text-sm text-warmgray-800">Figma</li>
                <li class="font-sans text-sm text-warmgray-800">Tokens Studio</li>
                <li class="font-sans text-sm text-warmgray-800">Storybook</li>
                <li class="font-sans text-sm text-warmgray-800">Prototyping</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-mono text-xs text-warmgray-700 uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">Engineering</p>
              <ul class="space-y-2">
                <li class="font-sans text-sm text-warmgray-800">React</li>
                <li class="font-sans text-sm text-warmgray-800">JavaScript (ES6+)</li>
                <li class="font-sans text-sm text-warmgray-800">HTML and CSS</li>
                <li class="font-sans text-sm text-warmgray-800">Node.js</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-mono text-xs text-warmgray-700 uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">Process</p>
              <ul class="space-y-2">
                <li class="font-sans text-sm text-warmgray-800">UX Strategy</li>
                <li class="font-sans text-sm text-warmgray-800">Usability Testing</li>
                <li class="font-sans text-sm text-warmgray-800">WCAG 2.1 AA</li>
                <li class="font-sans text-sm text-warmgray-800">Agile / Scrum</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-mono text-xs text-warmgray-700 uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">Languages</p>
              <ul class="space-y-2">
                <li class="font-sans text-sm text-warmgray-800">JavaScript</li>
                <li class="font-sans text-sm text-warmgray-800">Java</li>
                <li class="font-sans text-sm text-warmgray-800">Python</li>
                <li class="font-sans text-sm text-warmgray-800">SQL</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-xl text-warmgray-800 mb-6">Get in touch</h2>
        <p class="font-sans text-base text-warmgray-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
          I am looking for a product-focused team that takes the design-to-engineering handoff seriously and wants someone who can lead from both sides of it.
        </p>
        <nav aria-label="Professional links" class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-3 font-mono text-sm mb-6">
          <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/eliana-betancur" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-rust-700 underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-rust-600 transition-colors focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-rust-600 focus-visible:outline-offset-2">LinkedIn</a>
          <a href="https://github.com/gneliana" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-rust-700 underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-rust-600 transition-colors focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-rust-600 focus-visible:outline-offset-2">GitHub</a>
          <a href="https://www.figma.com/design/U49gXIbwVYqFNFQnUIWLqv/Eliana-Betancur---DS?node-id=91-4755" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-rust-700 underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-rust-600 transition-colors focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-rust-600 focus-visible:outline-offset-2">Figma</a>
          <a href="/resume.pdf" class="text-rust-700 underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-rust-600 transition-colors focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-rust-600 focus-visible:outline-offset-2">Download resume</a>
        </nav>
        <p class="font-mono text-sm text-warmgray-600">
          Or email directly: <a href="mailto:eliana.c.betancur@gmail.com" class="text-rust-700 underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-rust-600 transition-colors">eliana.c.betancur@gmail.com</a>
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-reveal {
    animation: rise 0.6s ease-out both;
  }
  @keyframes rise {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(12px); }
    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .page-reveal { animation: none; }
  }
</style>